  "description": "Dynaset P over F at row 3 (Move 2), held Field N of P; Clone into C (held N of C) and C.Move 1; derived recordset D = P.OpenRecordset() with held N. P.Requery; then read C's BOF, EOF, ID, Bookmark, RecordCount and held N; C.MoveNext and read ID; read D's ID and held N and RecordCount; read P's BOF, EOF, ID, held N and Bookmark. Then db.Execute INSERT INTO F (ID, N) VALUES (9, 90); C.Requery; read P's RecordCount and ID, walk P's ID to EOF from its position; P.Requery; read C's RecordCount and ID, MoveLast and read. Asks whether Requery on the parent affects the clone, the derived recordset and held Field objects, and what a clone's Requery makes visible to the parent. The fixture copy is opened read-write.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
  "observationRecipe": [
